{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"جمل أطول ومفردات أقلّ شيوعًا. الكلمات الجديدة في معظمها مشروحة أدناه."},{"btype":"example","text":"Don't keep the TV on!","note":"لا تبق التلفاز مفتوحاً!"},{"btype":"example","text":"You keep out of this.","note":"ابق خارج هذا الموضوع."},{"btype":"example","text":"Where does he keep his dog?","note":"أين يدع كلبه؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"It was hard to keep up with Tom.","note":"كان من الصعب اللحاق بتوم."},{"btype":"example","text":"If you want to keep your job, do this.","note":"إن أردت الحفاظ على وظيفتك، فافعل هذا."},{"btype":"example","text":"I'll be here all week.","note":"سأكون هنا طوال الأسبوع."},{"btype":"example","text":"She will get well in a week.","note":"ستتحسن خلال أسبوع."},{"btype":"example","text":"I have been here for a week.","note":"أنا هنا منذ أسبوع."},{"btype":"example","text":"Dan will call Linda next week.","note":"سيتصل دان بليندا الأسبوع القادم."},{"btype":"example","text":"I am going to Europe next week.","note":"سأذهب إلى أوروبا الاسبوع المقبل."},{"btype":"example","text":"Things are so bad.","note":".الأمور سيئة للغاية"},{"btype":"example","text":"I've had a bad day.","note":"أمضيت يوما سيّئا."}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":6,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.dictation","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"en","lang_name":"الإنجليزية","sentences":[{"t":"Don't keep the TV on!","ar":"لا تبق التلفاز مفتوحاً!"},{"t":"You keep out of this.","ar":"ابق خارج هذا الموضوع."},{"t":"Where does he keep his dog?","a